---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="About Load Plan Calc, free calculators for loading cartons into shipping containers and onto pallets.">
  <section class="prose">
    <h1>About Load Plan Calc</h1>
    <p class="lede">Load Plan Calc is a free set of tools for one job: working out how cartons fit into a shipping container or onto a pallet before the truck arrives.</p>
    <p>Enter the boxes you have, and the planner shows how many fit, how much space and payload is used, and a 3D loading plan you can turn, step through and share. Everything runs in your browser; nothing you type is sent to us.</p>
    <p>Container sizes come from the carriers' own published specifications, and every figure links to its source. See <a href="/how-we-calculate/">how we calculate</a> for the method and its limits. The site is independent and supported by advertising.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
